        <mxCell id="rv5woYXykiygoUiSsRmY-541" value="• Multi-AZ deployment for high availability&#xa;• Private subnets for app &amp; data layers&#xa;• NAT Gateway for outbound internet&#xa;• Service discovery via AWS Cloud Map&#xa;• Secrets managed by Secrets Manager&#xa;• Container images in ECR&#xa;• All services behind ALB&#xa;• PostgreSQL multi-schema isolation&#xa;• Redis for session management&#xa;• Event-driven with SNS/SQS&#xa;• CloudWatch monitoring &amp; logging&#xa;• SSL/TLS encryption throughout" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9;spacingLeft=5;spacingTop=5;labelBackgroundColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="rv5woYXykiygoUiSsRmY-540">
